{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07708","headline":"疾愈过龙泉寺精舍呈易业二公 · 孟浩然","name":"疾愈过龙泉寺精舍呈易业二公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"停午闻山钟，起行散愁疾。\n寻林采芝去，转谷松翠密。\n傍见精舍开，长廊饭僧毕。\n石渠流雪水，金子耀霜橘。\n竹房思旧游，过憩终永日。\n入洞窥石髓，傍崖采蜂蜜。\n日暮辞远公，虎溪相送出。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}